Adapted source code
-------------------

Files adapted from other GPL projects. They keep the original copyright notice,
start with "Adapted from <repo>/<path>@<commit sha>", stay under GPL-3.0 as
published upstream, and do NOT carry the app-store permission.

  File in this repository                      | Adapted from (repo/path@sha)                                                                                        | Copyright                      | Licence
  ---------------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------------------------------+--------
  ios/ShareExtension/ShareViewController.swift | github.com/lichess-org/mobile ios/ShareExtension/ShareViewController.swift@f4543db42b8d5fb4d4fd533fa56218a4a34eb667 | the lichess-org/mobile authors | GPL-3.0

The share extension is a separate executable inside the app bundle
(Runner.app/PlugIns/ShareExtension.appex). Everything else in ios/ShareExtension
(Info.plist, entitlements, privacy manifest) and the app's side of the hand-off
(ios/Runner/SharedPgnInbox.swift, lib/core/links) was written for this app.

Expected further sources: lichess-org/mobile (move list, evaluation chart).
lib/core/chess wraps chessground through its public API and adapts none of its
source.


Vendored source code
--------------------

third_party/chessground/ is a trimmed copy of the chessground Flutter package,
used as a path dependency. It is not a fork with its own history: the files
are upstream's, unchanged except for the removals listed in
third_party/chessground/BOGNER_CHANGES.md, and they stay under GPL-3.0 as
published upstream. They do NOT carry the app-store permission.

  Directory                | Upstream                                   | Version / commit                                  | Copyright                       | Licence
  -------------------------+--------------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------+---------------------------------+--------
  third_party/chessground/ | github.com/lichess-org/flutter-chessground | 10.2.0 / 4b4f1d4734a453cfbe43a37cac95be09d8d1b0bc | the flutter-chessground authors | GPL-3.0

dartchess (chess rules, FEN, SAN, PGN; GPL-3.0, github.com/lichess-org/dartchess)
