Third-party packages
--------------------

Dart and Flutter packages are listed with version, licence and purpose in
docs/dependencies.md. Their licence texts are shown in the app (Settings ->
About and licences -> Open-source licences), which Flutter collects from the
packages themselves. The artwork and the vendored source listed above are added
to that list by lib/features/about/domain/additional_licenses.dart; a new row in
this file needs a new entry there.
